        "original_id": "6efae334-a625-5f18-9326-2f594dd0ac6e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Seimas, Sejm of Poland, Sejm of the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth\n- Places: Grand Duchy of Lithuania, Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth\n- Events: Union of Lublin\n\nFacts:\n- Seimas, also called Sejm or Sojm and in Belarusian Сойм, was an early parliament in the Grand Duchy of Lithuania.\n- The Union of Lublin created the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth.\n- The Union of Lublin joined the Seimas of Lithuania with the Sejm of Poland into one new organization.\n- The bicameral parliament of the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth was officially titled the Sejm of the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth.",
