        "original_id": "5d10045b-ad17-5940-957f-7f6f67be119c",
        "text": "Seimas (\"Sejm\", \"Sojm\", Belarusian: Сойм ) was an early parliament in the Grand Duchy of Lithuania, The Union of Lublin created a new state, the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth, and joined the Seimas of Lithuania with Sejm of Poland into one new organization, the bicameral parliament of the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth is officially titled \"Sejm of the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth\".",
