        "original_id": "7e1244ce-696b-5691-9b9c-136e541345d4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Union of Lublin\n- Organizations: Seimas of Lithuania, Sejm of Poland, Sejm of the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth\n- Places: Grand Duchy of Lithuania, Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth\n- Concepts: general sejm, bicameral parliament\n\nFacts:\n- The Union of Lublin created the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth as a new state.\n- The Union of Lublin joined the Seimas of Lithuania and the Sejm of Poland into the Sejm of the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth.\n- The general sejm, or sejm walny, was the bicameral parliament of the Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth.",
